{"repo": {"timestamp": 1795457987480, "version": 30000, "name": "caracole", "icon": "icon.png", "address": "https://danielhp95.github.io/caracole/fdroid/repo", "description": "The caracole Android app: your caracole library of chord sheets, lyrics and guitar parts on the phone, offline. Built and signed by its author."}, "requests": {"install": [], "uninstall": []}, "apps": [{"authorName": "Daniel Hernandez", "categories": ["Multimedia", "Reading"], "suggestedVersionCode": "2", "description": "caracole keeps a copy of your caracole library on the phone and runs caracole\nthere, so it works with the computer off.\n\n* Your library, offline: the library page, every sheet with all its tools\n  (key, capo, chord diagrams, harmony, pinyin, strum), kept versions,\n  harmonica tabs and songbooks.\n* Search and fetch from the phone: the computer's site indexes come with a\n  sync, so the phone's search finds songs on the sites offline.\n* Sync with your computer: the two libraries each take what the other\n  changed; where both changed a song, you pick which to keep.\n* Guitar Pro on the phone: a file drawn as score and tab and played.\n* Share to caracole: share a song from a music app to find it or fetch it.\n\nIt needs a computer running caracole serve to sync from:\nhttps://github.com/Danielhp95/caracole", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/Danielhp95/caracole/issues", "license": "MIT", "name": "caracole", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/Danielhp95/caracole", "summary": "Your caracole library of chord sheets, offline on the phone", "webSite": "https://github.com/Danielhp95/caracole", "added": 1795452413998, "packageName": "io.github.danielhp95.caracole", "lastUpdated": 1795457986600, "localized": {"en-US": {"icon": "icon_0KLk2aqwcpzCtpoHV29FKQcTfUpVMTJnSIwghCtGem4=.png", "phoneScreenshots": ["phone-chord.png", "phone-pinyin.png"], "whatsNew": "More informative startup screen\n"}}}], "packages": {"io.github.danielhp95.caracole": [{"added": 1795457986600, "apkName": "i